<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>India News | Latest India News Today &amp; Real-time News from India, India Breaking News</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india</link><description>India News Today: Get latest India news and breaking news from India on Times of India. TOI brings the top news headlines from India on Politics, Elections, Current Affairs and more</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-10-25T01:31:27+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/-2128936835.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Sun, 25 Oct 2026 01:31:27 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>India News | Latest India News Today &amp; Real-time News from India, India Breaking News</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india</link></image><item><title><![CDATA[Farooq Abdullah's comments on Pakistan and Kashmir draw flak]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/farooq-abdullahs-comments-on-pakistan-and-kashmir-draw-flak/articleshow/135176756.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135176756.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Farooq urged NC workers and legislators to remain loyal to the party, whether in power or not, as he touched on a range of issues in his speech. “Hold on to the truth. Speaking the truth is not easy, but unless you remain truthful and stand up for what is right, your future will never be secure,” the veteran said.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/farooq-abdullahs-comments-on-pakistan-and-kashmir-draw-flak/articleshow/135176756.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/farooq-abdullahs-comments-on-pakistan-and-kashmir-draw-flak/articleshow/135176756.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-25T00:34:45+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Naseer Ganai</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135177116,imgsize-140014.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Daughter’s inheritance rights can’t be defeated by limitation: J&amp;K and Ladakh high court]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/daughters-inheritance-rights-cant-be-defeated-by-limitation-jk-and-ladakh-high-court/articleshow/135176758.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135176758.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The dispute dates back to Sept 14, 1982, when Themu, daughter of late Sonu, filed a civil suit claiming half share in land measuring 58 kanals and 11 marlas left behind by her father. She challenged mutation no. 43 dated Oct 15, 1966, which had been entered exclusively in favour of one Shib Devi and sought declaration of her inheritance rights along with consequential possession.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/daughters-inheritance-rights-cant-be-defeated-by-limitation-jk-and-ladakh-high-court/articleshow/135176758.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/daughters-inheritance-rights-cant-be-defeated-by-limitation-jk-and-ladakh-high-court/articleshow/135176758.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-25T00:30:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sanjay Khajuria</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135177024,imgsize-60023.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Set to expand cabinet, J&amp;K CM Omar Abdullah asks hopefuls not to ‘mob or spam’ him]]></title><description>&lt;a hr