robe-alleged-sting-attempts-on-cms/articleshow/135174716.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-24T22:44:28+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vivek Dubey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135174834,imgsize-158400.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘PMLA case not examined’: ED moves Supreme Court against HC order quashing proceedings against NewsClick]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/pmla-case-not-examined-ed-moves-supreme-court-against-hc-order-quashing-proceedings-against-newsclick/articleshow/135174093.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135174093.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/pmla-case-not-examined-ed-moves-supreme-court-against-hc-order-quashing-proceedings-against-newsclick/articleshow/135174093.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/pmla-case-not-examined-ed-moves-supreme-court-against-hc-order-quashing-proceedings-against-newsclick/articleshow/135174093.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-24T22:19:01+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135174124,imgsize-18162.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[RG Kar victim's parents question ex-principal Sandip Ghosh's bail; citizens' groups plan CBI office march]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rg-kar-victims-parents-question-ex-principal-sandip-ghoshs-bail-citizens-groups-plan-cbi-office-march/articleshow/135173539.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135173539.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The parents of the RG Kar victim are expressing their outrage over the bail granted to Sandip Ghosh, insisting that the investigation into their daughter's tragic death must be held accountable. Plans are underway for a protest organized by citizens' groups, pressing the Central Bureau of Investigation for urgent action. Family members and medical professionals alike have raised serious concerns regarding the efficacy and integrity of the ongoing investigation.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rg-kar-victims-parents-question-ex-principal-sandip-ghoshs-bail-citizens-groups-plan-cbi-office-march/articleshow/135173539.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rg-kar-victims-parents-question-ex-principal-sandip-ghoshs-bail-citizens-groups-plan-cbi-office-march/articleshow/135173539.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-24T21:57:19+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135173895,imgsize-85028.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Opposes BJP by lineage': BJP MLA's swipe at Naseeruddin Shah over SRFTI row]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/opposes-bjp-by-lineage-bjp-mlas-swipe-at-naseeruddin-shah-over-srfti-row/articleshow/135173463.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135173463.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/opposes-bjp-by-lineage-bjp-mlas-swipe-at-naseeruddin-shah-over-srfti-row/articleshow/135173463.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/opposes-bjp-by-lineage-bjp-mlas-swipe-at-naseeruddin-shah-over-srfti-row/articleshow/135173463.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-24T21:30:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vivek Dubey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135173540,imgsize-48408.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[EC declares UP MLC poll at three Agra stations 'void', orders repoll on October 26]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ec-declares-up-mlc-poll-at-three-agra-stations-void-orders-repoll-on-october-26/articleshow/135173478.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135173478.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ec-declares-up-mlc-poll-at-three-agra-stations-void-orders-repoll-on-october-26/articleshow/135173478.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ec-declares-up-mlc-poll-at-three-agra-stations-void-orders-repoll-on-october-26/articleshow/135173478.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-24T21:25:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Bharti Jain</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135173486,imgsize-90240.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Act of treason’: BJP slams Farooq Abdullah over claim 'Pakistan is protecting Kashmiris']]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/act-of-treason-bjp-slams-farooq-abdullah-over-claim-pakistan-is-protecting-kashmiris/articleshow/135173056.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135173056.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[In recent developments, BJP leaders have taken strong issue with Farooq Abdullah's comments regarding Pakistan's alleged support for Kashmiris. Abdullah, speaking at a workers' gathering, cast doubt on the central government's approach to Jammu and Kashmir, raising questions about India's commitment to justice. In response, BJP representatives charged him with treason, claiming his remarks weaken India's stance on the issue.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/act-of-treason-bjp-slams-farooq-abdullah-over-claim-pakistan-is-protecting-kashmiris/articleshow/135173056.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/act-of-treason-bjp-slams-farooq-abdullah-over-claim-pakistan-is-protecting-kashmiris/articleshow/135173056.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-24T21:17:24+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135173544,imgsize-140014.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Sri Lanka, Bangladesh happen when protests are not allowed’: Sonam Wangchuk on anti-SIR stir crackdown]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sri-lanka-bangladesh-happen-when-protests-are-not-allowed-sonam-wangchuk-on-anti-sir-stir-crackdown/articleshow/135172609.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135172609.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sri-lanka-bangladesh-happen-when-protests-are-not-allowed-sonam-wangchuk-on-anti-sir-stir-crackdown/articleshow/135172609.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sri-lanka-bangladesh-happen-when-protests-are-not-allowed-sonam-wangchuk-on-anti-sir-stir-crackdown/articleshow/135172609.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-24T20:46:46+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135173017,imgsize-75094.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Congress to launch door-to-door campaign, hold marches over voter list 'discrepancies']]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/congress-to-launch-door-to-door-campaign-hold-marches-over-voter-list-discrepancies/articleshow/135172497.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135172497.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Congress aims to register all eligible citizens by the end of December through an extensive campaign. The campaign will include marches, pamphlet distribution, and awareness meetings in both urban and rural areas. Booth-level agents will be appointed to help verify the accuracy of voter lists and report discrepancies. Allegations have arisen regarding significant irregularities affecting millions of voters across the country.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/congress-to-launch-door-to-door-campaign-hold-marches-over-voter-list-discrepancies/articleshow/135172497.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/congress-to-launch-door-to-door-campaign-hold-marches-over-voter-list-discrepancies/articleshow/135172497.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-24T20:15:19+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135172614,imgsize-149992.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[CBI books IL&amp;FS Energy Development Co. and top directors in Rs 212 crore Canara Bank fraud case]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cbi-books-ilfs-energy-development-co-and-top-directors-in-rs-212-crore-canara-bank-fraud-case/articleshow/135172350.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135172350.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cbi-books-ilfs-energy-development-co-and-top-directors-in-rs-212-crore-canara-bank-fraud-case/articleshow/135172350.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cbi-books-ilfs-energy-development-co-and-top-directors-in-rs-212-crore-canara-bank-fraud-case/articleshow/135172350.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-24T20:03:43+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Raj Shekhar Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135172491,imgsize-95086.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[NMC weighs five-year rotation of HoDs after stakeholder feedback]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nmc-weighs-five-year-rotation-of-hods-after-stakeholder-feedback/articleshow/135172062.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135172062.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The National Medical Commission is considering an update to the rotation period for heads of departments in medical colleges. This revision aims to change the tenure from three years to five years based on stakeholder feedback. The original proposal also included both professors and eligible associate professors, which will now be restricted. A detailed response to an RTI application has confirmed that the proposal is still under consideration.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nmc-weighs-five-year-rotation-of-hods-after-stakeholder-feedback/articleshow/135172062.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nmc-weighs-five-year-rotation-of-hods-after-stakeholder-feedback/articleshow/135172062.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-24T19:43:43+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Anuja Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135172238,imgsize-99950.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[RML’s 666-bed super speciality block gets fire safety clearance, set to boost critical care]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rmls-666-bed-super-speciality-block-gets-fire-safety-clearance-set-to-boost-critical-care/articleshow/135171939.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135171939.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Dr Ram Manohar Lohia Hospital's new 666-bed super speciality block has successfully secured fire safety clearance, allowing the hospital's capacity to soar past 2,200 beds. This cutting-edge facility will house numerous operation theatres along with specialized units for intensive and high dependency care, focusing on enhancing treatment, particularly in oncology. The timeline for when services will start is still pending.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rmls-666-bed-super-speciality-block-gets-fire-safety-clearance-set-to-boost-critical-care/articleshow/135171939.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rmls-666-bed-super-speciality-block-gets-fire-safety-clearance-set-to-boost-critical-care/articleshow/135171939.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-24T19:28:29+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Anuja Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135172041,imgsize-101846.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['We urge Indian businesses to continue and expand trade with Tehran': Envoy]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/we-urge-indian-businesses-to-continue-and-expand-trade-with-tehran-envoy/articleshow/135171796.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135171796.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/we-urge-indian-businesses-to-continue-and-expand-trade-with-tehran-envoy/articleshow/1